00:02:28.861 --> 00:02:29.848
while i'm answering this question.

00:02:29.848 --> 00:02:31.740
Alex this is a ludacris question.

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:34.491
This question pisses me off so much

00:02:34.491 --> 00:02:35.397
that it's starting to start

00:02:35.397 --> 00:02:36.999
